BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:github-actions/ndk-26-removal-2026
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260113
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 26 is removed from the GitHub runner im
 ages
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Android NDK 26 will be removed from all supported
  images.\nWho: Android apps that pin NDK 26.3.11579264 and are built on a 
 GitHub-hosted image without it (the removal started on 2026-01-12 and took
  about 3 days). Gradle can install it during the build when its license is
  accepted\; otherwise the build can fail.\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/ndk-26-removal-202
 6/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 26 is removed from the GitHub runne
 r images: in 30 days
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 26 is removed from the GitHub runne
 r images: in 7 days
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:github-actions/node20-actions
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260924
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: Actions declaring node20 now run on Node 24
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Node 20 is no longer available on GitHub Actions 
 runners. Runners now use Node 24 for JavaScript actions.\nWho: JavaScript 
 actions whose action.yml declares runs.using node20\, on GitHub-hosted run
 ners\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/node20-actions/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Actions declaring node20 now run on Node 24: in
  30 days
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Actions declaring node20 now run on Node 24: in
  7 days
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:github-actions/ndk-28-removal-2026
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 28 is removed from the GitHub runner im
 ages
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Only workflows that explicitly use NDK 28 (via nd
 kVersion or an NDK 28 path) are affected once it's removed.\nWho: Android 
 apps that pin NDK 28.2.13676358 and are built on a GitHub-hosted image wit
 hout it (Ubuntu and Windows since October 2026\; the macOS images still ha
 d it on 2026-11-24). Gradle can install it during the build when its licen
 se is accepted\; otherwise the build can fail.\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/ndk-28-removal-202
 6/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 28 is removed from the GitHub runne
 r images: in 30 days
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 28 is removed from the GitHub runne
 r images: in 7 days
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:github-actions/ubuntu-latest-26.04
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: ubuntu-latest moves to Ubuntu 26.04
DESCRIPTION:What happens: ubuntu-latest moves from Ubuntu 24.04 to Ubuntu 2
 6.04: This change will be rolled out over a period of several weeks beginn
 ing October 19\, 2026. We plan to complete the migration by November 19\, 
 2026.\nWho: GitHub-hosted x64 jobs on ubuntu-latest\nLast verified 2026-11
 -24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/ubuntu-latest-26.0
 4/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
