BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:github-actions/macos-intel-retirement-2027
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270831
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270901
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: macOS Intel (x86_64) runner images end
DESCRIPTION:What happens: The x86_64 macOS label macos-15-intel is availabl
 e until August 2027\, and after that date the x86_64 architecture will not
  be supported on GitHub Actions: no day published yet.\nWho: GitHub-hosted
  jobs on a macOS Intel (x64) image\, in any repository (macos-15-intel\, m
 acos-15-large\, macos-26-intel\, macos-26-large\, macos-latest-large\; tab
 le gha-runner-labels)\nDate precision: Aug 2027\nLast verified 2026-11-28
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/macos-intel-retire
 ment-2027/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: macOS Intel (x86_64) runner images end: in 30 d
 ays
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: macOS Intel (x86_64) runner images end: in 7 da
 ys
TRIGGER:-P7D
